</div></a><a data-wf--global-cta-blue--variant="full-width-height" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truage" class="cta_blue w-variant-94260c0e-959b-bc05-fe6a-acd750cb1b17 w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular purple">Read more about TruAge</div><div class="cta_blue-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g clip-path="url(#clip0_11191_621)">
<path d="M18 17C18 17.5523 17.5523 18 17 18C16.4477 18 16 17.5523 16 17V9.41406L7.70703 17.707C7.31651 18.0976 6.68349 18.0976 6.29297 17.707C5.90244 17.3165 5.90244 16.6835 6.29297 16.293L14.5859 8H7C6.44772 8 6 7.55228 6 7C6 6.44772 6.44772 6 7 6H17C17.5523 6 18 6.44772 18 7V17Z" fill="#1A126E"></path>
