</div></a></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="w-tab-pane" id="w-tabs-2-data-w-pane-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="w-tabs-2-data-w-tab-1"><div class="report_tabs-panel-content"><div class="text-regular blue lh-130">TruAge identifies factors contributing to accelerated or decelerated aging and evaluates how different parts of your body age both independently and synchronously, creating actionable insights. The recommendations throughout the report can assist in informing your patient's lifestyle and targeted interventions, enabling you to optimize their health and potentially slow down the aging process.<br><br>In the TruHealth report, biomarkers identified as suboptimal have personalized lifestyle and supplement recommendations provided. prior epigenetic biomarker values can be compared against to offer insight into progress and areas that may need continued attention.</div></div><div class="diagnostic_links top"><a data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant="full-width-height" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#" class="cta-yellow w-variant-5b9601e6-6a59-2b05-1b12-8de340a701eb w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular blue cta">Apply as a Provider</div><div class="cta-yellow-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
