</div><div class="text-regular tabs">Pitfalls</div></a></div><div class="w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="report_tabs-panel w-tab-pane w--tab-active" id="w-tabs-3-data-w-pane-0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="w-tabs-3-data-w-tab-0"><div class="report_tabs-panel-content"><div class="text-regular blue lh-130">A transparent disclosure of the analytical pipeline, including array specifications, bioinformatic normalization, and the rigorous validation standards that ensure clinical-grade accuracy.</div></div><div class="diagnostic_links top"><a data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant="full-width-height" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/work-with-us" class="cta-yellow w-variant-5b9601e6-6a59-2b05-1b12-8de340a701eb w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular blue cta">Join Our Provider Network</div><div class="cta-yellow-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
