</div></a></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="w-tab-pane" id="w-tabs-4-data-w-pane-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="w-tabs-4-data-w-tab-2"><div class="report_tabs-panel-content"><div class="text-regular blue lh-130">Retesting too soon (under 3 months) rarely shows significant epigenetic shift.</div></div><div class="diagnostic_links top"><a data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant="full-width-height" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#" class="cta-yellow w-variant-5b9601e6-6a59-2b05-1b12-8de340a701eb w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular blue cta">Apply as a Provider</div><div class="cta-yellow-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
