</clipPath>
</defs>
</svg>
</div></a></div></div><div class="patient_quote-desktop"><a data-wf--global-cta-blue--variant="icon" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#" class="cta_blue w-variant-c3b2b046-7739-8e20-1c00-79861621aaca w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular purple">Read more about TruAge</div><div class="cta_blue-icon w-variant-c3b2b046-7739-8e20-1c00-79861621aaca w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
