</div></div></div><div id="patientSlider" class="patient_slider swiper swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-pointer-events swiper-backface-hidden"><div class="patient_slider-list swiper-wrapper" id="swiper-wrapper-ed31f6a45f4a18c4" aria-live="polite" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);"><div class="patient_slider-item swiper-slide new swiper-slide-active" role="group" aria-label="1 / 4" style="width: 932.5px; margin-right: 24px;"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a197ad4eaf2c9530216de2b_Feature%20Card.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="patient_slider-item-bg"><div class="patient_slider-item-number"><div class="title-h4-v2 blue">1</div></div><div class="text-regular relative white">OMICmAge gives the headline and acts like the overall odometer for the whole body – "how many miles are on the car?"</div></div><div class="patient_slider-item swiper-slide swiper-slide-next" role="group" aria-label="2 / 4" style="width: 932.5px; margin-right: 24px;"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a197d00b3eac598ff2b3d29_Feature%20Card%20(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="patient_slider-item-bg"><div class="patient_slider-item-number"><div class="title-h4-v2 blue">2</div></div><div class="text-regular relative white">SymphonyAge gives the system map and acts like an odometer for each system/organ – "how many miles are on the engine (heart), how many on the brain, etc.?"</div></div><div class="patient_slider-item swiper-slide new" role="group" aria-label="3 / 4" style="width: 932.5px; margin-right: 24px;"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a197ce6debf5ef93c8d1eb2_Feature%20Card%20(2).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="patient_slider-item-bg"><div class="patient_slider-item-number"><div class="title-h4-v2 blue">3</div></div><div class="text-regular relative white">DunedinPACE gives the rate and is like the speedometer – "how fast is the body aging right now?"</div></div><div class="patient_slider-item swiper-slide new" role="group" aria-label="4 / 4" style="width: 932.5px; margin-right: 24px;"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a197cdc01bbf3759e26a571_Feature%20Card%20(3).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="patient_slider-item-bg"><div class="patient_slider-item-number"><div class="title-h4-v2 blue">4</div></div><div class="text-regular relative white">Check the 3-month trend to validate protocol efficacy.</div></div></div><span class="swiper-notification" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_why white"><div class="padding-global-8 new"><div class="container-new"><div class="why_wrapper modify"><div class="why_title-wrap"><h2 class="title-h2-new blue">How to interpret TruHealth</h2></div><div class="why_text-wrap"><div class="text-regular blue">TruHealth dives deeper into specific physiological systems, providing granular data on how lifestyle choices are impacting inflammation, metabolic/glycemic signaling, lipids/vascular signaling.</div></div><div id="aboutSlider" class="about_slider swiper modify swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-pointer-events swiper-backface-hidden"><div class="about_slider-wrapper swiper-wrapper" id="swiper-wrapper-4cd8368410e396d96" aria-live="polite" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);"><div class="about_item swiper-slide new light-purple swiper-slide-active" role="group" aria-label="1 / 3" style="margin-right: 24px;"><div class="about_item-icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1999abd836578fedf31edb_Icon%20(3).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="about_item-icon-img"></div><h4 class="about_item-title">What TruHealth tells you</h4><div class="about_item-content new modify"><div class="text-small-medium">Specific methylation scores for inflammation, metabolic/glycemic signaling, lipids/vascular signaling and more.</div></div></div><div class="about_item swiper-slide new light-purple swiper-slide-next" role="group" aria-label="2 / 3" style="margin-right: 24px;"><div class="about_item-icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1999e0eeccb22ae3481de6_Icon%20(5).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="about_item-icon-img"></div><h4 class="about_item-title">What TruHealth does not tell you</h4><div class="about_item-content new modify"><div class="text-small-medium">Fixed outcomes. It shows current biological stress, which can change by nutrition, lifestyle, and other factors.</div></div></div><div class="about_item swiper-slide new light-purple" role="group" aria-label="3 / 3" style="margin-right: 24px;"><div class="about_item-icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a1999d1a9df9d67df5bb6a4_Icon%20(4).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="about_item-icon-img"></div><h4 class="about_item-title">When to use it</h4><div class="about_item-content new modify"><div class="text-small-medium">When a patient wants to optimize their health, or may have a specific health concern, or when you need to justify more intensive dietary or supplement interventions.</div></div></div></div><span class="swiper-notification" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_patient blue"><div class="padding-global new"><div class="container-new"><div class="patient_wrapper"><div class="patient_content blue"><div class="patient_strapline"><div class="strapline-text white">PATIENT SCRIPT</div></div><div class="patient_quote"><div class="patient_quote-title-wrap"><div class="code-embed-7 w-embed"><svg width="29" height="24" viewBox="0 0 29 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M29 13.2308L29 24H17.7908V16.9231C17.7908 9.64102 19.3333 5.33333 22.3156 0L27.5603 0C25.6064 4.92307 24.3723 8.30769 24.3723 13.2308H29ZM11.1064 13.2308L11.1064 24H0L0 16.9231C0 9.64102 1.64539 5.33333 4.42199 0L9.66667 0C7.8156 4.92307 6.58156 8.30769 6.58156 13.2308L11.1064 13.2308Z" fill="white" fill-opacity="0.2"></path>
</svg>
</div><div class="title-h4-v2 white">While your overall epigenetic biomarkers are favorable, your <strong>TruHealth markers show some elevated stress</strong> in the metabolic system. This confirms why you've been feeling more fatigue after meals lately.</div></div></div><div class="patient_content-cta-mobile"><a data-wf--global-cta-transparent--variant="icon" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truhealth" class="cta-transparent w-variant-396bb51c-5704-af00-38f9-f3219788e7c7 w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular white cta">Read more about TruHealth</div><div class="cta-transparent-icon w-variant-396bb51c-5704-af00-38f9-f3219788e7c7 w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
